[9.277, "o", "# Release readiness: product `rr-product-70454-21053`\r\n\r\nGenerated: 2026-08-29T16:00:00Z\r\n\r\n## Scope and rules\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** Product scope; 3 visible bugs (#847, #848, #849); bounded rolling collection.\r\n- **Assumption:** `RESOLVED` and `CLOSED` are complete; `Highest` priority or `release-blocker` whiteboard text is blocking; stale means 30 days; time zone is UTC.\r\n- **Fact:** Authorization can hide bugs, so this report does not claim an unobservable total.\r\n\r\n## Readiness assessment\r\n\r\n- **Assessment:** not ready.\r\n- **Fact:** 1/3 visible bugs match a configured blocker (#849).\r\n\r\n## Blockers\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** #849 is open with `Highest` priority and the configured whiteboard marker.\r\n\r\n## Dependency risks\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** 1 unresolved outgoing dependency (#847) blocks #849.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n## Stale or unowned work\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** 0 stale and 0 unowned open bugs under the stated assumptions.\r\n\r\n## Recent adverse changes\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** #849 has 1 visible status-change record since 2020-01-01.\r\n\r\n## Decisions needed\r\n\r\n- **Assessment:** Decide whether #849 can be cleared and whether dependency #847 must close before the release proceeds.\r\n\r\n## Data limitations\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** Rolling snapshot, visible rows only; custom fields observed: 0; no custom-field rule was assumed.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n## Source commands\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "```text\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr --server <server-profile> bug search --from-url <credential-free-url> --limit 100 --paginate --json --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr --server <server-profile> query show release-readiness-demo --json\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> query run release-readiness-demo --limit 100 --paginate --json --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> bug list --product rr-product-70454-21053 --target-milestone --- --limit 100 --paginate --json --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr --server <server-profile> bug list --version rr-version-70454-5123 --limit 100 --paginate --json --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr --server <server-profile> bug list --product rr-product-70454-21053 --limit 100 --paginate --json --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr --server <server-profile> bug view 849 --json --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr --server <server-profile> bug history 849 --since 2020-01-01 --json\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> bug links 849 --relation depends_on --json\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> field list status --json\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr --server <server-profile> server capabilities --json\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> schema bug\r\n```\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "## Evidence appendix\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "- **Fact:** Blocker IDs: #849. Dependency-risk IDs: #847. Visible IDs: #847, #848, #849.\r\n"]
